railer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Border Patrol: Checkpoint Control VR", "keywords": ["checkpoint", "security", "inspection", "border", "Smugglers"], "long_description": "You are the last line of defense at the border.\nEveryone looks innocent\u2026 but some are hiding dangerous contraband.\n\nScan travelers. Inspect vehicles. Catch smugglers before they slip through.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Core Gameplay\n\nEvery decision matters.\n\nOne mistake can let a smuggler escape\u2026 or stop an innocent person.\n\n\ud83d\udec2 Document Verification\n\nCheck passports for mismatches, expired data, and forged identities.\nSpot small details\u2014because smugglers rely on your mistakes.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Vehicle Inspection\n\nSearch vehicles, cargo, and hidden compartments.\nFind illegal items, concealed goods, and cleverly hidden contraband.\n\n\ud83e\uddcd Traveler Screening\n\nScan travelers for suspicious behavior and hidden threats.\nSome will lie. Some will panic. Some will try to trick you.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f High-Stakes Decisions\n\nApprove, deny, detain, or escalate.\nYour choices affect security, efficiency, and what happens next.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Built for VR\n\nFully interactive tools, immersive environments, and intuitive controls designed for Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udd12 Disclaimer\n\nThis is a fictional experience created for entertainment.", "short_description": "Scan travelers. Catch smugglers. Stop hidden threats. Verify documents, search vehicles, scan travelers, and enforce checkpoint protocols in immersive VR. One mistake can let danger cross the border. "}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2104975103479261", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u56fd\u5883\u691c\u67fbVR\uff1a\u5bc6\u8f38\u72af\u3092\u898b\u3064\u3051\u308d", "keywords": ["\u56fd\u5883", "\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u30dd\u30a4\u30f3\u30c8", "\u691c\u67fb", "\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3", "\u5b89\u5168"], "long_description": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u56fd\u5883\u306e\u6700\u5f8c\u306e\u9632\u885b\u7dda\u3002\n\u4e00\u898b\u7121\u5b9f\u3067\u3082\u3001\u5371\u967a\u306a\u5bc6\u8f38\u54c1\u3092\u96a0\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u8005\u304c\u3044\u308b\u3002\n\u65c5\u884c\u8005\u3092\u691c\u67fb\u3057\u3001\u8eca\u4e21\u3092\u8abf\u3079\u3001\u5bc6\u8f38\u72af\u3092\u963b\u6b62\u305b\u3088\u3002\n\ud83c\udfaf \u30b3\u30a2\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\n\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u5224\u65ad\u304c\u91cd\u8981\u3002\n\u30df\u30b9\u3059\u308c\u3070\u5bc6\u8f38\u72af\u3092\u9003\u3059\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002\n\ud83d\udec2 \u66f8\u985e\u78ba\u8a8d\n\u30d1\u30b9\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u306e\u4e0d\u6b63\u3084\u77db\u76fe\u3092\u898b\u629c\u3051\u3002\n\ud83d\ude97 \u8eca\u4e21\u691c\u67fb\n\u96a0\u3055\u308c\u305f\u8377\u7269\u3092\u63a2\u305b\u3002\n\ud83e\uddcd \u4eba\u7269\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\n\u4e0d\u5be9\u306a\u884c\u52d5\u3092\u898b\u9003\u3059\u306a\u3002\n\u26a0\ufe0f \u91cd\u8981\u306a\u5224\u65ad\n\u8a31\u53ef\u3001\u62d2\u5426\u3001\u62d8\u675f\u3002\n\ud83c\udfae VR\u5c02\u7528\u8a2d\u8a08\nMeta Quest\u5411\u3051\u306b\u6700\u9069\u5316\u3002\n\ud83d\udd12 \u6ce8\u610f\n\u672c\u4f5c\u306f\u30d5\u30a3\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "short_description": "\u65c5\u884c\u8005\u3092\u30b9\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u3057\u3001\u5bc6\u8f38\u72af\u3092\u898b\u629c\u3051\u3002\n\u305f\u3063\u305f\u4e00\u3064\u306e\u30df\u30b9\u304c\u5371\u967a\u3092\u62db\u304f\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1759827341708869", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Contr\u00f4le Fronti\u00e8re VR : Attrapez les Pas", "keywords": ["fronti\u00e8re", "checkpoint", "inspection", "simulation", "zombie"], "long_description": "Vous \u00eates la derni\u00e8re ligne de d\u00e9fense \u00e0 la fronti\u00e8re.\nTout le monde semble innocent\u2026 mais certains cachent des marchandises ill\u00e9gales.\n\nScannez les voyageurs. Inspectez les v\u00e9hicules. Arr\u00eatez les passeurs avant qu\u2019ils ne passent.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Gameplay principal\nChaque d\u00e9cision compte.\nUne erreur peut laisser un criminel s\u2019\u00e9chapper\u2026 ou arr\u00eater un innocent.\n\n\ud83d\udec2 V\u00e9rification des documents\nAnalysez les passeports, d\u00e9tectez les faux et les incoh\u00e9rences.\nLes passeurs comptent sur vos erreurs.\n\n\ud83d\ude97 Inspection des v\u00e9hicules\nFouillez les coffres, cargaisons et compartiments cach\u00e9s.\nD\u00e9couvrez des objets ill\u00e9gaux et des contrebandes.\n\n\ud83e\uddcd Contr\u00f4le des voyageurs\nObservez les comportements suspects.\nCertains mentent. D\u2019autres paniquent.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f D\u00e9cisions \u00e0 haut risque\nAutorisez, refusez, d\u00e9tenez ou enqu\u00eatez davantage.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Con\u00e7u pour la VR\nInteractions immersives optimis\u00e9es pour Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udd12 Avertissement\nExp\u00e9rience fictive \u00e0 but de divertissement.", "short_description": "Scannez les voyageurs. Arr\u00eatez les passeurs. Stoppez les menaces cach\u00e9es.\nUne erreur peut laisser le danger franchir la fronti\u00e8re."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "872168139106101", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Control Fronterizo Atrapa Contrabandista", "keywords": ["control", "simulaci\u00f3n", "inspecci\u00f3n", "seguridad", "frontera"], "long_description": "Eres la \u00faltima l\u00ednea de defensa en la frontera.\nTodos parecen inocentes\u2026 pero algunos esconden contrabando.\nInspecciona viajeros. Revisa veh\u00edculos. Atrapa contrabandistas antes de que escapen.\n\ud83c\udfaf Jugabilidad principal\nCada decisi\u00f3n importa.\nUn error puede cambiarlo todo.\n\ud83d\udec2 Verificaci\u00f3n de documentos\nDetecta pasaportes falsos y errores.\n\ud83d\ude97 Inspecci\u00f3n de veh\u00edculos\nBusca en compartimentos ocultos.\n\ud83e\uddcd Control de viajeros\nDetecta comportamientos sospechosos.\n\u26a0\ufe0f Decisiones cr\u00edticas\nPermitir, negar o detener.\n\ud83c\udfae Dise\u00f1ado para VR\nOptimizado para Meta Quest.\n\ud83d\udd12 Aviso\nExperiencia ficticia.", "short_description": "Escanea viajeros. Atrapa contrabandistas. Det\u00e9n amenazas ocultas.\nUn error puede dejar pasar el peligro."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4387429048198240", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\uad6d\uacbd \uac80\ubb38 VR: \ubc00\uc218\ubc94 \uc7a1\uae30", "keywords": ["\uad6d\uacbd", "\uccb4\ud06c\ud3ec\uc778\ud2b8", "\uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158", "\ubcf4\uc548"], "long_description": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uad6d\uacbd\uc758 \ub9c8\uc9c0\ub9c9 \ubc29\uc5b4\uc120\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\ubaa8\ub450\uac00 \ud3c9\ubc94\ud574 \ubcf4\uc774\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc77c\ubd80\ub294 \uc704\ud5d8\ud55c \ubb3c\uac74\uc744 \uc228\uae30\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\uc5ec\ud589\uc790\ub97c \uac80\uc0ac\ud558\uace0 \ucc28\ub7c9\uc744 \uc218\uc0c9\ud558\uc5ec \ubc00\uc218\ubc94\uc744 \uc7a1\uc73c\uc138\uc694.\n\ud83c\udfaf \ud575\uc2ec \uac8c\uc784\ud50c\ub808\uc774\n\ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc120\ud0dd\uc774 \uc911\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\ud83d\udec2 \uc11c\ub958 \uac80\uc0ac\n\uc704\uc870 \uc5ec\uad8c\uacfc \uc624\ub958\ub97c \ucc3e\uc544\ub0b4\uc138\uc694.\n\ud83d\ude97 \ucc28\ub7c9 \uac80\uc0ac\n\uc228\uaca8\uc9c4 \ubb3c\ud488\uc744 \ubc1c\uacac\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n\ud83e\uddcd \uc5ec\ud589\uc790 \uac80\uc0ac\n\uc758\uc2ec\uc2a4\ub7ec\uc6b4 \ud589\ub3d9\uc744 \ud30c\uc545\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n\u26a0\ufe0f \uc911\uc694\ud55c \uacb0\uc815\n\ud5c8\uc6a9, \uac70\ubd80 \ub610\ub294 \uccb4\ud3ec.\n\ud83c\udfae VR \ucd5c\uc801\ud654\nMeta Quest\uc6a9 \uc124\uacc4.\n\ud83d\udd12 \uc548\ub0b4\n\uac00\uc0c1\uc758 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.", "short_description": "\uc5ec\ud589\uc790\ub97c \uc2a4\uce94\ud558\uace0 \ubc00\uc218\ubc94\uc744 \uc7a1\uc544\ub77c.\n\ud55c \ubc88\uc758 \uc2e4\uc218\uac00 \uc704\ud5d8\uc744 \ucd08\ub798\ud55c\ub2e4."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1026584860005196", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Grenzkontrolle VR: Schmuggler fassen", "keywords": ["Grenzkontrolle", "Kontrollpunkt", "Inspektion", "Simulation", "zombie"], "long_description": "Du bist die letzte Verteidigungslinie an der Grenze.\nAlle wirken harmlos\u2026 doch manche verstecken gef\u00e4hrliche Schmuggelware.\nKontrolliere Reisende. Durchsuche Fahrzeuge. Fasse Schmuggler, bevor sie entkommen.\n\ud83c\udfaf Kern-Gameplay\nJede Entscheidung z\u00e4hlt.\nEin Fehler kann einen Schmuggler entkommen lassen.\n\ud83d\udec2 Dokumentenkontrolle\n\u00dcberpr\u00fcfe P\u00e4sse auf F\u00e4lschungen und Unstimmigkeiten.\n\ud83d\ude97 Fahrzeugkontrolle\nDurchsuche Fahrzeuge und versteckte Bereiche.\n\ud83e\uddcd Personenkontrolle\nErkenne verd\u00e4chtiges Verhalten.\n\u26a0\ufe0f Kritische Entscheidungen\nErlauben, verweigern oder festnehmen.\n\ud83c\udfae F\u00fcr VR entwickelt\nOptimiert f\u00fcr Meta Quest.\n\ud83d\udd12 Hinweis\nFiktives Spiel zu Unterhaltungszwecken.", "short_description": "Reisende scannen. Schmuggler entlarven. Versteckte Gefahren stoppen.\nEin Fehler kann alles ver\u00e4ndern.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://engaginggamesstudio.com/privacy.htm", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Engaging Games Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://engaginggamesstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "37921197314161008"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310726_987038654370475_2291686448898338737_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YoHuqrgeWpoQ7kNvwEhLZf_&_nc_oc=Adq6unzBcsc-MBUdy8LoP2J_570KG_Vh68yAhW24-EAj7W5zmQ_VAvrH-xpBetzXI_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKp-KLV5Hio8a9wg0vP2-fJZX3aQWE_DDf1Kkeu_zo8JA&oe=6AA17640"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Border Patrol: Checkpoint Control VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Adventure", "id": "2691890164460465"}, {"topic_name": "Narrative", "id": "1008279844328894"}, {"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1768487700, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "33237479285866191", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "33237479149199538", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1217580693685023"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "3829853220500407", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_3829853223833740_6419114379489351253_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RdIi2NG-RSsQ7kNvwGrCTCJ&_nc_oc=AdrLRChDQuHGum1t1qFor